        "id": "ViktorW",
        "name": "Gravity Field",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Viktor conjures a heavy gravitational field that slows enemies caught within its radius. Enemies who stay in the field for too long become stunned.<br><br>Augment: Viktor's spells apply a slow to enemies.<br>",
        "bodyHtml": "Viktor deploys a gravitational imprisonment device for 4 seconds, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies inside it by 33/36/39/42/45%. Enemies who remain within its radius for 1.25 seconds are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> for 1.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Upgraded Passive:</span> Viktor's Abilities <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> by 20% for 1 second.<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Enemies that are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> by this Ability are also <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Down</span>.</span>",
