        "summary": "Viktor uses his biomechanical arm to fire a Hextech Ray that cuts across the field in a line, dealing damage to all enemies in its path.<br><br>Augment: An explosion follows in the Hextech Ray's wake, dealing magic damage.<br>",
        "bodyHtml": "Viktor fires a hextech ray in a chosen direction, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/110/150/190/230 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to any enemies it hits.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Upgraded:</span> An aftershock follows Hextech Ray, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(20/50/80/110/140 + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><br />",
