      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "ViktorR",
        "name": "Arcane Storm",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Viktor conjures an Arcane Storm on the field, dealing magic damage and interrupting enemy channels. The storm periodically does magic damage to all nearby enemies and can be redirected by Viktor.<br><br>Augment: The Arcane Storm moves 25% faster, and whenever champions die after taking damage from it, the storm grows and increases in its duration.<br><br>",
        "bodyHtml": "Viktor conjures an Arcane Storm in an area for 6.5 seconds, which instantly deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/175/250 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> followed by <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(65/105/145 + (35% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per second to surrounding enemies. The storm automatically follows champions it has recently damaged.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> Viktor can manually move the storm.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Upgraded:</span> The storm moves 25% faster. If a champion that the storm has damaged dies, the storm increases its size and its duration by 3 seconds (up to 6 times).<br /><br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">When the storm appears it interrupts channeled Abilities.<br />The farther the storm is from Viktor, the slower it moves.</span>",
